


 Minutes of the FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

Date: 01/25/90   Time: 22:27EST

FIGGY BAR of 25 January 1990. Tonite's question: Do you prefer the 
syntax of DO...LOOP or FOR...NEXT ? Any reason(s) ?
These constructs in 'C', and other construct conumdrums. Is index at fault ?
Attendees:
[[Gary] GARY-S]
[[Doug] D.PHILIPS2]
[[Dave] OLORIN]
[[Wil] W.BADEN1]

Minutes:
<D.PHILIPS2> is here.
