<[Wil] W.BADEN1> Ok, now write that in C.
<[Doug] D.PHILIPS2> 'It is crossing this boundary that causes the loop to 
terminate.'
<[Doug] D.PHILIPS2> Ok Wil, have you tried it yet?  (How well do you know C?)
<[Wil] W.BADEN1> I dont have anything I like yet.
<[Doug] D.PHILIPS2> You mean functionally or esthetically?
<[Wil] W.BADEN1> (I wrote my first C in 1975.)
<[Dave] OLORIN> Urggh.
